* LT3094 Negative LDO: -7V input to -5.0V output, light resistive load
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* Genuine Analog Devices LT3094 macromodel is instantiated below.
* Pin order of the LT3094 subcircuit (LTspice lib/sub/LT3094.sub):
*   IN  OUT  SET  ILIM  PGFB  PG  OUTS  GND
* ---------------------------------------------------------------

.include LT3094.sub

* ---------------- Source (negative rail, short ramp for clean startup)
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 0 200u -7)

* ---------------- Input / output capacitors
Cin  IN  0 10u
Cout OUT 0 10u

* ---------------- LT3094 negative low dropout regulator
XU1 IN OUT SET ILIM PGFB PG OUTS 0 LT3094

* SET pin programs the output: VOUT = -100uA * RSET = -100u * 50k = -5.0V
RSET SET 0 50k

* ILIM tied to IN for the internal (maximum) current limit
RILIM ILIM IN 0.001

* Output sense tied to the load point (Kelvin sense)
ROUTS OUTS OUT 0.001

* Power-good monitoring not used: disable feedback, keep PG node terminated
RPGFB PGFB 0 1
RPG   PG   0 1Meg

* ---------------- Light resistive load: -5V / 1k = 5 mA
RL OUT 0 1k

* ---------------- Analysis
.tran 0 5m 0 2u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=4m TO=5m

.options plotwinsize=0
.end
